          {
            "at": 6.4,
            "end": 10.68,
            "text": "And it's been one of my biggest dreams in my life.\n这一直是我人生最大的梦想之一"
          },
          {
            "at": 10.68,
            "end": 14.76,
            "text": "And I'm just super happy that I was able to give my best\n很开心我能拼尽全力"
          },
          {
            "at": 14.76,
            "end": 16.5,
            "text": "and win the match and win this tournament.\n赢下比赛，赢下这个赛事"
